              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "crepundia, crepundiōrum — \"a rattle; childhood toys\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Nūtrīx īnfantī crepundia dedit. The nurse gave the baby a rattle."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter, plural only. In comedies a lost child is recognised by the little toys kept in a box."
            }
          ]
        },
