            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Pater fīliō praenōmen avī dedit. The father gave his son his grandfather's first name."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter, 3rd declension: the name before the family name. Romans had few first names and wrote them short."
            }
